{"id":"72fcab1b1a0c4d18","group":"68","path":"68/68-prop-inessential-expansion-undecidability.md","title":"Strong Undecidability Descends through Constants","display":"prop-inessential-expansion-undecidability — Strong Undecidability Descends through Constants","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-prop-inessential-expansion-undecidability","aliases":["68-prop-inessential-expansion-undecidability"],"display":"prop-inessential-expansion-undecidability — Strong Undecidability Descends through Constants","depends_on":["[[68-df-inessential-expansion]]","[[68-df-theory-decidability]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§11 Proposition 11.2 pp.35-36 / PDF 44-45","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-constant-elimination-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-prop-inessential-expansion-undecidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-prop-inessential-expansion-undecidability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-inessential-expansion-undecidability — Strong Undecidability Descends through Constants"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3af2451590e4ff1d\" href=\"?note=3af2451590e4ff1d\" title=\"68-df-inessential-expansion\">68-df-inessential-expansion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11bfe06b58ad0c0f\" href=\"?note=11bfe06b58ad0c0f\" title=\"68-df-theory-decidability\">68-df-theory-decidability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11 Proposition 11.2 pp.35-36 / PDF 44-45"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-constant-elimination-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InessExp}_{68}(M,\\sigma,M&#39;,\\sigma&#39;)\">\\(\\operatorname{InessExp}_{68}(M,\\sigma,M&#39;,\\sigma&#39;)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3af2451590e4ff1d\" href=\"?note=3af2451590e4ff1d\" title=\"68-df-inessential-expansion\">68-df-inessential-expansion</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Model}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{Model}_{68}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11bfe06b58ad0c0f\" href=\"?note=11bfe06b58ad0c0f\" title=\"68-df-theory-decidability\">68-df-theory-decidability</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\Longrightarrow(\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}(\\sigma&#39;,T))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\Longrightarrow(\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}(\\sigma&#39;,T))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}(M&#39;,\\sigma&#39;)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}(M,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}(M&#39;,\\sigma&#39;)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}(M,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Proposition 11.2，印刷 pp.35–36 / PDF pp.44–45；已阅读两页陈述和证明。对旧语言公理集 T，新语言不加公理：把查询闭句中实际出现的新常元替换为彼此不同、未出现在该句中的变量，再全称闭包。取变量编号大于句中所有变量编号，故替换不会捕获。新常元在模型中可以任意解释，所得旧语言闭句为 T 的后承，当且仅当原新语言闭句为新语言 T 的后承；空常元列表直接返回原句。有限语法树扫描、寻找最大变量编号、替换与全称前缀都是对编码的全递归操作，所以旧语言判定器产生新语言判定器。反向只需查询旧语言句子，非法码输出 0。若 T 以 M 为模型，则新语言同一公理集以 M′ 为模型，强不可判定前提迫使其不可判定，上述等价给原 T 不可判定。首式展开了原书证明中使用的判定问题等价；无新增结构假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-inessential-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"3af2451590e4ff1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-inessential-expansion]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-theory-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"11bfe06b58ad0c0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-theory-decidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-inessential-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"3af2451590e4ff1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{InessExp}_{68}(M,\\sigma,M',\\sigma')$，见 [[68-df-inessential-expansion]]。$\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}$、$\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}$、$\\operatorname{Model}_{68}$ 与 $\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}$ 见 [[68-df-theory-decidability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-theory-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"11bfe06b58ad0c0f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{InessExp}_{68}(M,\\sigma,M',\\sigma')$，见 [[68-df-inessential-expansion]]。$\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}$、$\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}$、$\\operatorname{Model}_{68}$ 与 $\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}$ 见 [[68-df-theory-decidability]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{InessExp}_{68}(M,\\sigma,M',\\sigma')","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Model}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\Longrightarrow(\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}(\\sigma',T))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}(M',\\sigma')\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}(M,\\sigma).","display":true}],"bytes":2290,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-prop-inessential-expansion-undecidability]] — proposition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-prop-inessential-expansion-undecidability|prop-inessential-expansion-undecidability — Strong Undecidability Descends through Constants]]"}],"outgoing":["3af2451590e4ff1d","11bfe06b58ad0c0f"]}